
  Kali-PS4 - Kali Linux on the PlayStation 4
  By Chokri Hammedi (blue0x1) - https://github.com/blue0x1

  Internal Wi-Fi has no monitor mode: plug in a USB adapter for wireless work.
  SSH is ON (kali/kali) - change the password now:  passwd
  Turn SSH off:  sudo systemctl disable --now ssh
  Connect Wi-Fi:  nmtui
  Install tools:  sudo apt update && sudo apt install kali-tools-top10

